===Etymology===
From earlier {{der|en|nl|gurken||small pickled cucumber}}, shortened form of {{der|en|stq|augurk}}{{attention|stq}}, perhaps from {{der|en|gkm|ἀγγούριον|tr=angourion||cucumber}}, equivalent to {{suffix|en|gher|-kin}}, or alternatively as plural {{suffix|en|gherk|-en}}<ref>http://www.etymonline.com/index.php?term=gherkin</ref>.

